1Sa 30:1 , The Amalekites spoil Ziklag;
1Sa 30:4 , David asking counsel, is encouraged by God to pursue them;
1Sa 30:11 , By the means of a revived Egyptian he is brought to the enemies, and recovers all the spoil;
1Sa 30:22 , David's law to divide the spoil equally between them that fight and them that keep the stuff;
1Sa 30:26 , He sends presents to his friends.
